-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications and additions in this fork
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
The following are contributed by this project and are likewise released
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  * Heterogeneous / adaptive LoRA method implementations under
    `federatedscope/contrib/`:
      - FedIT             (FedAvg with fixed homogeneous LoRA ranks)
      - HetLoRA           (heterogeneous LoRA rank variants)
      - FAH-QLoRA         (adaptive heterogeneous rank + heterogeneous
                           quantization)
      - AdaSparse-LoRA    (v1/v2/v3: adaptive rank-1 component selection,
                           personalized communication budgets)

  * The real-device federated deployment stack under `distributed/`
    (control plane, protobuf bridge, server orchestrator, thin worker
    wrapper, Jetson container launch path).

  * Correctness fixes to the federated LoRA download/aggregation path,
    including `apply_distributed_lora_download` (rank-inferring key
    canonicalization with strict key consumption) and synchronized task-head
    federation. See docs/federation_bug.md.

